+### Cache dependencies
+
+`LlamaRAMCache` and its `LlamaCache` alias use in-memory caching and are
+available with the base package. `LlamaDiskCache` requires the optional disk
+dependency; install `llama-cpp-python[disk]` to use it. Server installations
+that set `cache_type` to `disk` also need this extra.
+
